ccd20&chksm=8a425862b1a60341f73ca44cd999183057ef091519c86640bf400c5577ed1dbf5985770cde26&scene=126&sessionid=1795563371#rd","description":"一条航班信息，可能被明码标价；一份投出去的简历，可能成为诈骗的入口。数字时代，个人信息早不是“姓名+电话”的简单集合。谁掌握了它，谁就可能掌握了某个人的钱包和行踪，甚至可以威胁其人身安全。打击惩治侵犯公民个人信息犯罪，事关每个人的切身利益。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fsz_mmbiz_jpg%2FLJwWAbW20CiaS07SBMnALd6EJM710ot5x9A1AnHVUpYs9mWBRq0oLVib7MKp6kmWQicC27iaeksDYefWTNd0wgqdTPfY5BIvYnpvIYXuicxnT9eU%2F300%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-23T09:54:45.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzA5MzE5MDAzOA%3D%3D:2664268685:4","title":"国际 | 法国发布新计划强化网络安全","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA5MzE5MDAzOA==&mid=2664268685&idx=4&sn=ca344d67463c8fb8e4a1c6ae19210bcd&chksm=8ab5625e52afcbcf35d20f2d41c22300aeb293f7db8d67225ab0d3bfa55ec392c06044a9d503&scene=126&sessionid=1795563371#rd","description":"法国总理勒科尔尼19日宣布一项旨在加强网络安全的政府计划，包括动用2亿欧元资金发展网络安全技术，强化法国数字主权，以及加强对民众数据和国家政府信息系统、关键基础设施及企业的网络安全防护。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FLJwWAbW20CiaYkzniaXmFdZzgiajnEYk3kBDx3H7fAcdSoibKFO3iacia6oibiaxP5uWdvjJpn2AOkAebpxDDRJyiaX8ep7iang3j8BAw3IbBQibvjw6BA%2F300%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","published":"2026-11-23T09:54:45.000Z"},{"id":"wxmp:MzA5MzE5MDAzOA%3D%3D:2664268668:1","title":"论坛·原创 | 美国炒作“工业规模蒸馏”的三重谬误与规则博弈","link":"http://mp.weixin.qq.com/s?__biz=MzA5MzE5MDAzOA==&mid=2664268668&idx=1&sn=750bbdd0d4ec982bf518d7a155f1809a&chksm=8a137f48876b78adfdff1c47536b13eb963046b2ee5ffab4f1b7236b5569a7b5af12aa7804ac&scene=126&sessionid=1795563371#rd","description":"美国以“工业规模蒸馏”为由对我国AI企业的指控，在技术维度存在逻辑谬误，在法律维度存在正当程序与管辖权缺陷，在战略维度体现为“泛安全化”的政治操作，其本质是以安全叙事包装排他性管制，试图将对华AI竞争从算力封锁延伸至能力封锁和规则封锁。","image":"http://script.findrss.cloud/img/wxmp?url=https%3A%2F%2Fmmbiz.qpic.cn%2Fmmbiz_jpg%2FLJwWAbW20CjNHwNvovFXjSbHS1y6dZJrQ0xmEMSpHayWUiaoP33CZicVriaHuV6zMMetsxGz2wAWL3VR0LAYRxBm6fYaAK5VSK1W4pUlR8N8Tk%2F640%3Fwxtype%3Djpeg%26wxfrom%3D25","type":"article","p